{"ticker":"CB","updated":"2026-11-07T03:02:27Z","profile":{"longName":"Chubb Limited","shortName":"Chubb Limited","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"Switzerland","website":"https://www.chubb.com","fullTimeEmployees":45000,"marketCap":139466555392,"trailingPE":12.794251,"forwardPE":12.385571,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.2516396,"pegRatio":2.8,"targetMeanPrice":373.21738,"targetHighPrice":425.0,"targetLowPrice":314.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.003,"earningsGrowth":0.044,"grossMargins":0.29797,"operatingMargins":0.20531,"profitMargins":0.18127,"totalRevenue":61939998720,"beta":0.286,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":384.26,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":282.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.1},"summary":"Chubb Limited provides insurance and reinsurance products worldwide. It operates in six segments: North America Commercial Property and Casualty (P&C) Insurance, North America Personal P&C Insurance, North America Agricultural Insurance, Overseas General Insurance, Global Reinsurance, and Life Insurance. The company offers property and general liability, workers' compensation, and umbrella; professional and management liability; environmental, health, and international coverages; and claims and risk management products and services, loss control, and engineering and complex claims management. It also provides homeowners, automobile and collector cars, valuable articles, and personal and excess liability insurance. In addition, the company offers multiple peril crop insurance and crop-hail insurance for farm, ranch, specialty (P&C), and commercial agriculture products; product and employer liability, business interruption, and specialty risk; property insurance products, including traditional commercial fire coverage, energy industry-related, marine, construction, and other technical coverages; personal accident and supplemental medical coverages, such as accidental death, business/holiday travel, specified disease, disability, medical and hospital indemnity, and income protection; and directors and officers, professional indemnity, cyber, surety, aviation, political risk, and s","summary_zh":"Chubb Limited 在全球範圍內提供保險和再保險產品。該公司經營六個業務部門：北美商業財產和意外傷害（P&C）保險、北美個人財產和意外保險、北美農業保險、海外普通保險、全球再保險和人壽保險。公司提供財產和一般責任、工人賠償和保護傘；專業和管理責任；環境、健康和國際報道；索賠和風險管理產品和服務、損失控制以及工程和複雜索賠管理。它還提供房主、汽車和收藏車、貴重物品以及個人和超額責任保險。此外，該公司還為農場、牧場、特色產品（P&C）和商業農業產品提供多種危險作物保險和作物冰雹保險；產品和雇主責任、業務中斷和專業風險；財產保險產品，包括傳統商業火災保險、能源行業相關保險、海事保險、建築保險以及其他技術保險；個人事故和補充醫療保險，例如意外死亡、商務/度假、海事保險、殘疾醫療和其他技術保險；個人事故和補充醫療保險，例如意外死亡、商務/度假、海事保險、殘疾醫療和住院醫療保健董事、醫療保健和住院","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":276.47,"h":278.08,"l":273.92,"c":277.47,"v":1343800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":276.33,"h":278.67,"l":276.33,"c":276.99,"v":1319900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":275.73,"h":277.49,"l":274.53,"c":277.45,"v":1559600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":277.41,"h":283.31,"l":276.73,"c":282.89,"v":1657000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":280.82,"h":282.51,"l":277.74,"c":278.11,"v":2115200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":277.45,"h":277.92,"l":273.56,"c":274.33,"v":2418200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":274.81,"h":275.48,"l":271.45,"c":272.02,"v":2705600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":272.79,"h":274.2,"l":271.99,"c":272.25,"v":3390800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":270.69,"h":275.0,"l":270.69,"c":274.28,"v":2034900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":274.46,"h":275.42,"l":273.0,"c":273.89,"v":3627700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":273.74,"h":275.25,"l":272.77,"c":273.0,"v":1821000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":272.83,"h":276.5,"l":271.83,"c":275.9,"v":1441900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":275.56,"h":279.59,"l":275.5,"c":278.26,"v":1755300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":279.76,"h":281.04,"l":277.28,"c":278.3,"v":1312500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":280.0,"h":282.16,"l":278.48,"c":280.69,"v":1032200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":280.41,"h":280.41,"l":277.55,"c":279.56,"v":1379000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":279.33,"h":282.89,"l":276.85,"c":282.25,"v":1583600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":281.57,